# Only needed for a split deployment (frontend and backend on different
# hosts/domains, e.g. Vercel + Render). Leave unset for local dev and for
# same-origin deployments (Docker Compose + nginx) — the app defaults to
# a relative "/api", which works via the Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts)
# or the nginx reverse proxy in production.
#
# This is a BUILD-TIME variable (baked into the JS bundle by Vite), not a
# runtime one — set it in your hosting provider's dashboard before the
# build step, not by editing files on a running server.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com/api
